%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/core_test.clj:147 (runtime-reduce-test)
testing: Reduce 2-arity preserves DW parameter order (item, acc)
元の形: core/reduce の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え (Clojure の関数引数を DW のラムダに訳した)
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
["a", "b", "c"] reduce (p_item, p_acc) -> (p_acc ++ "-" ++ p_item)
%%% output application/json
"a-b-c"
